{"t":"IBKR","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","employees":3283,"hq":"Greenwich, CT, United States","website":"https://www.interactivebrokers.com","summary_en":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc. operates as an automated electronic broker in the United States and internationally. The company engages in the execution, clearance, and settlement of trades in stocks, options, futures, foreign exchange instruments, bonds, precious metals, and cryptocurrencies; and the company provides custody, prime brokerage, securities, and margin lending services. It also offers custody and service accounts for hedge and mutual funds, ETFs, registered investment advisors, proprietary trading groups, introducing brokers, and individual investors. In addition, the company provides trading platforms, including IBKR Trader Workstation, IBKR Desktop, IBKR Mobile, and IBKR Client Portal platform, as well as IBKR GlobalTrader mobile application, and IBKR APIs, builds custom trading applications and automates any part of the trading process. Further, it offers IBKR Pro, IBKR Lite, IBKR Universal Account, insured bank deposit sweep program, investors' marketplace, mutual fund marketplace, bond marketplace, forecast and event contracts, fractional trading, no transaction fee program for exchange-traded funds, overnight trading hours, and karta visa infinite charge card. It serves institutional and individual customers through electronic exchanges and market centers. Interactive Brokers Group, Inc. was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Greenwich, Connecticut.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.는 미국 및 국제적으로 자동화된 전자 브로커로 운영됩니다. 회사는 주식, 옵션, 선물, 외환 상품, 채권, 귀금속 및 암호화폐 거래의 실행, 청산 및 결제에 참여합니다. 회사는 보관, 프라임 브로커리지, 증권 및 마진 대출 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 헤지 및 뮤추얼 펀드, ETF, 등록 투자 자문가, 자기 거래 그룹, 소개 중개인 및 개인 투자자에 대한 보관 및 서비스 계정을 제공합니다. 또한, 회사는 IBKR Trader Workstation, IBKR Desktop, IBKR Mobile 및 IBKR Client Portal 플랫폼을 포함한 거래 플랫폼과 IBKR GlobalTrader 모바일 애플리케이션 및 IBKR API를 제공하고 맞춤형 거래 애플리케이션을 구축하고 거래 프로세스의 모든 부분을 자동화합니다. 또한 IBKR Pro, IBKR Lite, IBKR Universal Account, 보험 보장 은행 예금 스윕 프로그램, 투자자 마켓플레이스, 뮤추얼 펀드 마켓플레이스, 채권 마켓플레이스, 예측 및 이벤트 계약, 부분 거래, 상장지수펀드 거래 수수료 없음 프로그램, 익일 거래 시간 및 카르타 비자 무한 충전 카드를 제공합니다. 전자 거래소 및 시장 센터를 통해 기관 및 개인 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.는 1977년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷 주 그리니치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":77.72,"mcap":132422533120.0,"pe":29.664124,"fpe":23.428127,"peg":1.0131,"ps":18.762049,"pb":5.665962,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":0.8,"beta":1.381,"hi52":98.75,"lo52":62.1},"fin":{"rev":7057999872.0,"rev_g":0.135,"eps_g":0.169,"gross":0.92661005,"op":0.77586,"net":0.16676001,"roe":0.23674,"fcf":null,"cash":129992998912.0,"debt":35885998080.0,"de":154.342,"eps":2.62,"feps":3.31738},"own":{"short":0.04,"inst":0.90209997,"insider":0.02675},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":104.1,"median":104.3,"high":120.0,"low":75.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.70588,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":117.0,"priorPriceTarget":115.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":100.0,"priorPriceTarget":105.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":100.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-07","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action